  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "description": "Structural intent/1 contract. States: green = working now; red = broken now or unreadable, and the headline names why. Extension discriminator selects mapping[propertyName value]; unknown/missing tags fail closed. Beyond this subset code enforces finite numbers; at >0 and <=now+300 seconds; headline <=160 code points; <=40 blocks; recursively <=200 code points/string, <=400 items/array, <=16 keys/object, lowercase ASCII keys of length 1..24 and depth <=6 from each block. Code enforces allowlisted link URLs, calendar-date/HH:MM/UTC timestamp and transcript-id patterns, schedule ascending at and runs descending started_at, wake job=null (and schedule heavy=false), job-kind job=string, <=100 runs. Tuple rules: day quiet/skips=[HH:MM,HH:MM]; funnel steps=[string,nonnegative integer,string]; chips items=[string,string]; learned demands=[string,string,string]. Optional day promises.met_at is null or HH:MM. Transport cap: 60000 bytes. These constraints deliberately remain code, not ignored schema keywords."
